{"chunk_id": "7f4f6416-8407-4112-9d26-5dadf0ca73fd", "doc_id": "xhs_005_tencent_ai_app_short", "text": "刚刚面完，还没出结果，手撕没撕出来，记录一下防止忘。", "chunker_name": "semantic", "source_type": "xiaohongshu", "level": 0, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "semantic_topic", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "腾讯 AI 应用开发暑期一面面经", "metadata": {"topic": "algorithm", "semantic_mode": "lexical", "n_blocks": 1}, "char_len": 26}
{"chunk_id": "091bc5fb-d52c-47e5-b978-7d976aea82eb", "doc_id": "xhs_005_tencent_ai_app_short", "text": "1. 自我介绍\n2. 拷打项目，都是些 Agent 项目，但是面试官想问后端服务架构的一些，我不太清楚\n3. 手撕 LRU，题目给得很简洁，真的就只有标题\n4. 反问", "chunker_name": "semantic", "source_type": "xiaohongshu", "level": 0, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "semantic_topic", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "腾讯 AI 应用开发暑期一面面经", "metadata": {"topic": "project", "semantic_mode": "lexical", "n_blocks": 1}, "char_len": 83}
{"chunk_id": "c9e25e96-bf03-4ca1-9f16-2f5d4d7731d8", "doc_id": "xhs_005_tencent_ai_app_short", "text": "个人感受：\n我记不清 LRU 的内容，还是太菜了。Agent 项目不能只会讲 prompt，要讲服务架构、缓存、数据库、接口、流式输出、部署。", "chunker_name": "semantic", "source_type": "xiaohongshu", "level": 0, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "semantic_topic", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "腾讯 AI 应用开发暑期一面面经", "metadata": {"topic": "agent_rag", "semantic_mode": "lexical", "n_blocks": 1}, "char_len": 71}
